{"nodes": [{"id": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_bootstrap_process", "label": "Platform stack bootstrap runbook", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_kms_binding", "label": "KMS decrypt binding for deployer SA (pulumi-secrets key)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Must be a gcloud grant (roles/cloudkms.cryptoKeyEncrypterDecrypter on the pulumi-secrets key), never a Pulumi gcp.kms.CryptoKeyIAMMember resource: declaring it in Pulumi fails with 'cloudkms.cryptoKeys.getIamPolicy denied', and the only role that would fix that (roles/cloudkms.admin) would let the deploy pipeline rewrite who is allowed to decrypt its own secrets -- the exact control the key exists to provide. Without it, CI fails at the very first `pulumi preview` with a KMS permission error."}, {"id": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_state_bucket_binding", "label": "Pulumi state bucket IAM binding (gs://branchleft-pulumi-state)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bucket-scoped roles/storage.objectAdmin grant, deliberately not a project-level storage role: the bucket holds state for four stacks, two owned by other repos (branchleft-website-infra, branchleft-shared-infra), so a project-level role here would let this repo's CI corrupt their state too. Without it every CI run fails at `pulumi login` with a 403, since Pulumi cannot grant itself access to the bucket it must log in to before it can grant anything."}, {"id": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_provisioning_user_incident", "label": "ghost_platform_provisioner privilege-narrowing incident (2026-08-05)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A live attempt to narrow ghost_platform_provisioner from cloudsqlsuperuser down to bare CREATE USER caused a real self-lockout: revoking the cloudsqlsuperuser role left the account with USAGE ON *.* only, and re-granting CREATE USER failed because no customer-accessible Cloud SQL account -- not even root -- holds GRANT OPTION on anything; only Google's own control plane can grant. Recovery required recreating the account via the Admin API (gcloud sql users delete/create) to re-run Google's provisioning path. Decision: accept the credential at full cloudsqlsuperuser breadth permanently; mitigated today only by zero consumers holding secretAccessor on its Secret Manager entry, a decision that must be re-opened before any future story wires a consumer to it."}, {"id": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_pulumi_state_bucket", "label": "Pulumi state backend (gs://branchleft-pulumi-state)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_kms_binding", "target": "infra_platform_pulumi_platform_stack_config", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_kms_binding", "target": "_github_workflows_infra_platform_ci_deployer_service_account", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_state_bucket_binding", "target": "_github_workflows_infra_platform_ci_deployer_service_account", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_state_bucket_binding", "target": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_pulumi_state_bucket", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_provisioning_user_incident", "target": "_github_workflows_infra_platform_ci_deployer_service_account", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_bootstrap_process", "target": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_kms_binding", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_bootstrap_process", "target": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_state_bucket_binding", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_bootstrap_process", "target": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_provisioning_user_incident", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_bootstrap_process", "target": "_github_workflows_infra_platform_ci_workload_identity_federation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_provisioning_user_incident", "target": "_github_workflows_infra_platform_ci_assert_no_platform_deletes", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "platform_bootstrap_identity_chain", "label": "Platform stack bootstrap identity chain", "nodes": ["infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_bootstrap_process", "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_kms_binding", "infra_platform_runbook_bootstrap_state_bucket_binding", "_github_workflows_infra_platform_ci_deployer_service_account"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "infra/platform/RUNBOOK-bootstrap.md"}]}